  "intro": [
    "Every ElastiCache operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane does with",
    "it. The control plane is the Query API (`Action=…`, XML answers) signed with the",
    "`elasticache` credential scope, and has no console action.",
    "With Docker the emulator starts real Redis/Valkey/Memcached containers; without",
    "it — the usual case, and the one the tests run against — every cache, group and",
    "user is a control-plane record whose endpoints point at the shared sidecar, so",
    "nothing here waits on an image. Stable names carry the read, modify and tag",
    "rows; delete actions make their own resource. A user group includes the built-in",
    "`default` user, which Redis groups require."
  ],
